# Time directories are solver OUTPUT and are regenerated by blockMesh plus
# buoyantBoussinesqSimpleFoam from the dictionaries beside them, which ARE
# tracked. This re-run wrote 8,600 of them across four cases.
#
# The rule lives HERE rather than in the repository .gitignore for one reason:
# that file is shared, it carried another lane's uncommitted work while this
# rung ran, and a write-back to a shared file is a merge. A directory-local
# ignore needs no merge and travels with the tree it describes. The pattern is
# the sibling rung's, at `.gitignore:153-157`.
#
# `[0-9]*` matches `0.orig` as well, which is why the negations are not
# optional: `0.orig` holds the initial conditions and is the one input a
# solver cannot regenerate. That glob deleted every initial condition in this
# tree once already.
*/[0-9]*/
!*/0.orig/
!*/0.orig/**

# The provenance copy of the committed 64x64 archive case is an INSTRUMENT, not
# a result. Its twelve dictionaries were proved byte-identical to
# `verification/runs/THERMAL_K0_runs/K0b_cavity_Ra1e5` by `cmp` over all 89
# files before it was measured, and the sibling rung's README states the
# principle this obeys: "there is one copy of it in the repository and it is the
# committed one." The measurement it produced is kept, in
# `measured_L64P.json`; the duplicate case is not.
K0b_m64_published/
